ros-lyrical-easynav-playground-tiago-worlds (0.5.0-1resolute) resolute; urgency=high

  * First release, in the easynav_playgrounds repository: Gazebo (Harmonic or newer) simulation of the PAL Robotics' TIAGo in the AWS RoboMaker small house, with their maps and the launchers that spawn the robot, without EasyNav dependencies
